  "comments": "<p><i>Obverse</i><br>Die <strong>1</strong> - dots on the sides of the date, interpunct in engraver's name R·JOLY.<br>Die <strong>2</strong> - dots on the sides of the date, space in engraver's name R JOLY.<br>Die <strong>3</strong> - mintmark and privy mark on the sides of the date, space in engraver's name R JOLY.<br><br><i>Reverse</i><br>Die <strong>A</strong> - mintmark and privy mark on the sides of the mask.<br>Die <strong>B</strong> - no marks on the sides of the mask.<br><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer ugc\" href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/6157627faff82.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/6157627faff82.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a><br><br><i>Combinations</i><br>Metal: nickel<br><strong>1</strong>+<strong>A</strong>: all issues from 1972 till 2001.<br><strong>2</strong>+<strong>A</strong>: 2002.<br><strong>2</strong>+<strong>B</strong>: 2002.<br><strong>3</strong>+<strong>B</strong>: 2003-2005.<br>Metal: copper-nickel<br><strong>3</strong>+<strong>B</strong>: 2005-2014.<br><br><br><i>Note</i>. Starting from 2005 the metal was changed into copper-nickel, those coins are in the next article N#30252.</p>",
